        <mxCell id="dashboard_source" value="Source: dashboard-read.controller.js receives a role-specific service, not a repository. dashboard-runtime.routes.js composes each dashboards/* service with its keyed durable repository. The shared read-projection.js validates role/session/scope, filters, schema and source evidence; unavailable/financial-policy-pending snapshots return pending rather than fabricated totals." vertex="1" parent="p_1" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="390" width="1080" height="120" />
        </mxCell>
